  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Bearded Skull Concealed Carry Hoodie provides comfortable, stylish, and effective access to your waistband carry weapon with a passthrough kangaroo pocket. This concealed carry sweatshirt features a red, white, &amp; blue bearded skull print on the chest and a red, white, and blue distressed US flag on right shoulder of concealed carry sweatshirt is reverse oriented in accordance with US military regulations. The patriotic sweatshirt is made with a high-performance moisture-wicking composition. The left sleeve features a zippered pocket and two pen pockets, while the right sleeve features an additional zippered pocket and a loop field for mounting flags and morale patches. The cuffs come equipped with thumbholes that provide additional warmth and keep the sleeves from riding up your arms.</p>",
